New file `src/kernel/locking/lock_events_list.rs` translates the selected
`LOCK_EVENT` expansions from `kernel/locking/lock_events_list.h`.

The candidate contains:

- `#[repr(i32)] enum lock_events` with the 38 selected `LOCKEVENT_*`
  discriminants in their upstream declaration order, 0 through 37.
- `LOCK_EVENT_NAMES`, the corresponding ordered source-name expansion used by
  the string-table include site in `kernel/locking/lock_events.c`.
- no PV qspinlock entries, because `CONFIG_PARAVIRT_SPINLOCKS` is unset in both
  frozen configurations.
